[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0000","text":"？？？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0010","text":"“我说你啊，摆出这副表情……也太犯规了吧”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0020","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0030","text":"“只有在我的怀中，您才能真正的绽放，mademoiselle”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0050","text":"对不起！让凛世久等了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0060","text":"──在看什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0070","text":"……\n『你露出那种表情……太犯规了』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0080","text":"——诶\n凛、凛世酱……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0090","text":"——……啊，啊——！\n是游戏的宣传片吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0100","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_11200100_01_0001","text":"Motion"}]
